  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Male role in transition</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Mansrollen i f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndring</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets huvudm&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja demokratisk utveckling i Ukraina. Syftet &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka allm&#xe4;nhetens insikt i den f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndrade mansrollen i dagens Ukraina. Projektet ska ocks&#xe5; upplysa den Ukrainska parten om hur man startar och driver ett manscentrum. Projektet skall resultera i etablering av ett antal manscenter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal is to support democratic development in Ukraine. The project&apos;s purpose to increase public awareness on the changing role of men in Ukraine. The project will also transfer knowledge to the Ukrainian party on how to start up and manage a center for men in crisis. The project will result in establishment of centers for men.</narrative>
  </description>
